<title>UK: BA strike ballot result due at 1400 GMT.</title>
<headline>BA strike ballot result due at 1400 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Transport and General Workers Union (T&amp;G) said on Monday it would publish the result of its strike ballot of 9,000 British Airways Plc ground staff at around 1400 GMT.</p>
<p>The result will coincide with a press briefing by the unions at their London offices, said a T&amp;G spokesman. This ballot result is the second within a week, following last week's vote by BA cabin crew over a separate dispute. The cabin crew vote was 73 percent in favour of strike action.</p>
<p>--London newsroom, +44 171 5427717.</p>
</text>
